- goStep(4) → goStep(2) in useQuickPortraitForVideo()
- Portrait grid still pre-populated silently so it's ready at step 4
- Toast updated: "Portrait set — now add your script"
- portraitBadge null-checked (was crashing if element missing)

Flow is now correct: Persona → Script → Voice → Scene → Generate

